---
import MakerLayout from '../../layouts/MakerLayout.astro';
import tools from '../../data/ai-tools.json';
---
<MakerLayout title="Free AI Tools — Prompt, Token, JSON & Developer Utilities" description="Free browser-based AI and developer tools: prompt generator, token counter, LLM cost calculator, JSON formatter, system prompt builder and more.">
<main class="home">
<section class="home-hero"><div class="hero-copy"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="live-dot"></span> FREE · NO ACCOUNT · BROWSER-FIRST</div><h1>AI work,<br><em>without the friction.</em></h1><p class="hero-lead">Prompt tools, token estimates, JSON utilities and developer helpers for ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini and the LLM stack.</p><div class="hero-search"><span>⌕</span><input id="aiSearch" type="search" placeholder="Search an AI tool…" autocomplete="off"><kbd>/</kbd></div></div><div class="hero-feature"><div class="feature-label">THE AI TOOLKIT</div><div class="feature-emoji">✦</div><div class="feature-body"><span>Local and free</span><h2>One job. One tool. Done.</h2><p>No account, no API key, no upload.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="section tools-section"><div class="section-intro"><div><span class="eyebrow">16 TOOLS</span><h2>Pick the problem.<br><em>Get the answer.</em></h2></div><p>Built for daily AI and developer workflows.</p></div><div class="tool-grid" id="aiGrid">{tools.map((t,i)=><a class="tool-card" data-search={t.label+' '+t.description+' '+t.keywords.join(' ')} href={`/ai/${t.slug}/`}><div class="tool-icon">{['✦','⌘','#','₿','▦','{}','→','◈','⇄','.*','≡','◉','64','JWT','Aa','⌁'][i]}</div><div class="tool-number">{String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')}</div><h3>{t.label}</h3><p>{t.description}</p><span class="tool-arrow">Open tool →</span></a>)}</div><div id="empty" class="no-results" hidden>No match. Try “prompt”, “token”, “JSON”, “developer” or “cost”.</div></section>
<section class="section signal-section"><div class="signal-card"><div class="signal-main"><span class="eyebrow">WHY THIS EXISTS</span><h2>The busywork around AI<br><em>is still busywork.</em></h2><p>Formatting prompts, checking JSON, estimating context and comparing costs are tiny jobs that happen constantly. PARADOX makes those jobs one browser tab away.</p></div><div class="signal-list"><a href="/ai/ai-token-counter/"><span>01</span><strong>Token counter</strong><small>Estimate prompt size</small></a><a href="/ai/llm-cost-calculator/"><span>02</span><strong>LLM cost calculator</strong><small>Estimate API spend</small></a><a href="/ai/json-formatter/"><span>03</span><strong>JSON formatter</strong><small>Validate AI output</small></a><a href="/ai/system-prompt-builder/"><span>04</span><strong>System prompt builder</strong><small>Create reusable instructions</small></a></div></div></section>
</main>
<script is:inline>(()=>{const i=document.querySelector('#aiSearch'),cards=[...document.querySelectorAll('#aiGrid .tool-card')],e=document.querySelector('#empty');i?.addEventListener('input',()=>{const q=i.value.toLowerCase().trim();let n=0;cards.forEach(c=>{const ok=!q||c.dataset.search.toLowerCase().includes(q);c.hidden=!ok;if(ok)n++});e.hidden=n>0});window.addEventListener('keydown',x=>{if(x.key==='/'&&document.activeElement!==i&&!['INPUT','TEXTAREA'].includes(document.activeElement.tagName)){x.preventDefault();i.focus()}})})();</script>
</MakerLayout>
